# Assets policy

- `recursos/` is gitignored — never commit Pokémon Essentials dumps.
- Do not add Nintendo / Essentials / official Pokémon rips under `public/`.
- BYO Essentials copy map: `docs/ASSETS.md` → `public/scene-assets/essentials/` (also gitignored).
- Committed demo art under `public/scene-assets/{tiles,objects,player,placeholders}/` was legacy CC crops (removed). The home uses `essentials/` from `pnpm import:essentials`.
- Update `/asset-credits` when demo licenses change.
